WEBVTT

00:02:58.396 --> 00:03:00.516
Colette Pichon Battle:
And while we're at it,

00:03:00.596 --> 00:03:03.116
let's make it just and fair for everyone.

00:03:03.156 --> 00:03:06.276
DC: No matter what has gone wrong,
what can go right?

00:03:06.316 --> 00:03:09.036
David Lammy: The solution
is to build a new coalition

00:03:09.116 --> 00:03:11.476
made up of all the groups most affected.

00:03:11.516 --> 00:03:15.796
Clover Hogan: Which story
gets in the way of you taking action?

00:03:15.836 --> 00:03:17.796
Challenge that story.

00:03:18.636 --> 00:03:20.956
DC: Our story takes place here.

00:03:21.076 --> 00:03:23.196
It's been difficult at times

00:03:23.236 --> 00:03:26.156
and could have unthinkable outcomes,

00:03:26.196 --> 00:03:28.196
but that was the story we used to tell.

00:03:29.516 --> 00:03:32.436
Now it’s up to us to tell a new one.